#12923
Terminus Forge~
   On this side of the archway, the roar of the flames is deafening, and it
comes from every direction. You are standing on a small, red rock, inside a
ring of rising fire, plummeting through the sky. A second rock, twice the size
of this one, floats just beyond the wall of fire and it, too, is engulfed in
flames.
Commands: forge, smelt, shatter <item to destroy>
