#12925
Terminus Forge~
   At the edge of the craggy stone platform, hefty stacks of boxes form a
make-shift wall. Beyond that, above the rim of the crater, you can see a pair
of half-moons hanging low in the sky. Above them blazes a fiery comet, slowly
moving through the air.
