#12926
Beneath a Mighty Rock~
   You squeeze through a narrow passage and into a larger chamber between the
massive, black rock. The walls here are glassy stone, carefully carved to
create space to mine the underside of the rock. Portal scars mar the walls and
floor from years of use.
~
